nd dap-lending waits until then.","body":{"conditions":"One reviewed head on aa016e0e that registers an archived-genesis scope in register mode and serves it under enforce, with ancestry and hash checks kept. Checker review of the exact head. The planner deploys.","priority":"urgent","target":"inherit","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}